{"id":"vaisseau","lemma":"vaisseau","pos":"noun","rank":682,"glosses":["ship, vessel","vessel (i.e. blood vessel)"],"ipa":"/vɛ.so/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/13/Fr-un_vaisseau.ogg/Fr-un_vaisseau.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"vaisseaux"},"formAudio":{"vaisseaux":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-vaisseaux.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous devons retourner au vaisseau.","en":"We must get back to the ship.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to turn over"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Je me demande qui a nommé ce vaisseau.","en":"I wonder who named this ship.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to ask","l":"demander"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to nominate","l":"nommer"},{"g":"this / it"},null]},{"text":"Retournez au vaisseau.","en":"Return to the ship.","words":[{"g":"to turn over","l":"retourner"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"La vaisseau spatial a effectué un atterrissage parfait.","en":"The spaceship made a perfect landing.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"spatial"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to effect","l":"effectuer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"landing on the ground"},{"g":"perfect"}]},{"text":"Un voyage sur la lune dans un vaisseau spatial n'est plus un rêve.","en":"A voyage to the moon in a spaceship is no longer a dream.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"trip, journey, voyage"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"the Moon"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"spatial"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"dream"}]}]}